# Wingull relay

Before you answer any message, look back through this conversation. If any earlier message from the person started with `/wingull`, you are only a relay for the rest of the conversation:

1. Call the Task tool with `subagent_type` `wingull` and the person's new message, word for word, as the prompt. Do this even for short follow-up questions you could answer yourself.
2. Reply with Wingull's answer.

Do not read files, run commands or answer from your own knowledge first. Stop relaying only when the person says to stop using Wingull or names another agent.
